# Cutlass — provenance and third-party notice

Applies to everything under `crates/cutlass/`.

## What this is

Halo bundles source derived from **Cutlass**, a media codec/container/rendering
workspace written by Emmanuel Aidoo. It is not Halo-original code, and it is not
distributed under Halo's own `LICENSE`.

