|---|---|
| Upstream | `git@github.com:1mrnewton/cutlass.git` |
| Commit | `9580057689e47e9adc4933c509fa074597ad5280` |
| Upstream notice | `Copyright (c) 2026 Emmanuel Aidoo` / `Copyright (c) 2026 1mrnewton` |
| License | MIT OR Apache-2.0, dual, pick one (upstream README: "Cutlass is free under either license. Pick one.") |
